{"Unlocked: the view fills the window, so wider (or taller) windows show more of the island - up to ultrawide; houses and dungeons keep their framing. Original 16:9: the game's own framing, with bars.", "鋪滿：畫面填滿視窗，因此更寬（或更高）的視窗會顯示更多島嶼——最大支援超寬屏；房屋和地下城保持原有構圖。原始 16:9：保持遊戲原有構圖，並顯示黑邊。"},
