{"Match display", "匹配螢幕"},
{"Dynamic", "動態"},
{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display: your screen's own resolution. Dynamic: as sharp as your GPU keeps at full speed. 1x-4x: the Switch's 1080p times that. 75%% / 50%% / 25%%: a share of the display, for slower machines.\n\nRendering at %.0f x %.0f.", "3D 畫面的清晰度。匹配螢幕：使用螢幕自身解析度。動態：在 GPU 滿速執行的前提下儘可能清晰。1x-4x：Switch 1080p 的倍數。75%% / 50%% / 25%%：顯示解析度的一定比例，適合較慢的裝置。\n\n當前渲染：%.0f x %.0f。"},
{" Dynamic: %.0f%% of the display right now.", " 動態：當前為螢幕的 %.0f%%。"},
{"Internal resolution", "內部渲染解析度"},
{"Bilinear", "雙線性"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the window when it renders at a lower resolution. MetalFX: Apple's upscaler, sharper. Bilinear: plain and soft.", "當以較低解析度渲染時，畫面如何放大到視窗。MetalFX：Apple 的放大演算法，更清晰。雙線性：簡單柔和。"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the window when it renders at a lower resolution. AMD FSR 1: edge-aware upscaling and sharpening, sharper. Bilinear: plain and soft.", "當以較低解析度渲染時，畫面如何放大到視窗。AMD FSR 1：邊緣感知放大與銳化，更清晰。雙線性：簡單柔和。"},
{"%s\n\nNot used at Match display: the game already renders at your display's resolution.", "%s\n\n“匹配螢幕”時不使用：遊戲已按螢幕解析度渲染。"},
{"Upscaler", "放大演算法"},
{"Anti-aliasing", "抗鋸齒"},
{"Smooths jagged edges of the game image before it is scaled to the window. SMAA: finds the edges and blends only along them, so textures stay sharp. Most useful at a lower internal resolution.", "在畫面放大到視窗之前平滑遊戲畫面的鋸齒邊緣。SMAA：只檢測邊緣並沿邊緣混合，因此紋理保持清晰。在較低內部渲染解析度下最有用。"},
