{"Asks for the display's fastest mode (on a 120 Hz screen): the game's 60 fps become 120, and its 30 become 120 too, with three in-between frames - heavier on the GPU. Off: the display at 60 Hz, the game's 30 become 60. Where the phone's own setting keeps the display faster (Settings > Display > Refresh rate), the in-between frames follow it.", "請求屏幕的最高刷新率（在 120 Hz 屏幕上）：遊戲的 60 fps 變爲 120，30 fps 也變爲 120，每兩幀之間插入三幀 —— GPU 負擔更重。關閉：屏幕保持 60 Hz，遊戲的 30 fps 變爲 60。若手機自身的設定讓屏幕保持更高刷新率（設定 > 顯示 > 刷新率），插幀數量會隨之調整。"},
