{"Copy them: the setup copies the game data into LAS Recomp's folder - your folder can be moved or deleted afterwards.\n\nUse them in place: the game reads its data from your folder (its romfs/ or romfs.bin), no copy - it saves the space and the wait. It needs the permission to access all files (Android asks), and the folder must stay where it is: moved or deleted, the game files have to be set up again.", "複製檔案：安裝過程會把遊戲數據複製到 LAS Recomp 自己的檔案夾 —— 之後你的檔案夾可以移動或刪除。\n\n就地使用：遊戲直接從你的檔案夾（其中的 romfs/ 或 romfs.bin）讀取數據，不做複製 —— 省下空間與等待時間。這需要「訪問所有檔案」權限（Android 會詢問），且檔案夾必須留在原處：一旦移動或刪除，就必須重新設定遊戲檔案。"},
