{"In-between frames made from the picture, the scene's depth and the camera's movement, shown between the game's own: its 30 fps become 60, or with 120 Hz on, its 60 become 120. Characters' own movement stays at the game's rate unless Objects' own movement is on. Pauses by itself when the game can't hold its frame rate. Takes effect at the next start of the app.", "根據畫面、場景深度和鏡頭移動生成中間幀，插入遊戲自身的幀之間：30 fps 變爲 60，開啓 120 Hz 後 60 變爲 120。除非開啓「物體自身移動」，角色自身的移動仍保持遊戲原本的幀率。當遊戲跑不滿幀率時會自動暫停插幀。下次啓動應用時生效。"},
