{"Sets up another release of the game (1.0.0, 1.0.1 or 1.1.0) from its own folder, next to the ones here: PLAY ‹ › on the start screen then switches between them. Each release takes its own space and builds its own game code once; saves are shared. The same release set up again replaces its copy.", "從各自的檔案夾設定遊戲的其他版本（1.0.0、1.0.1 或 1.1.0），與這裡的版本並列：在起始畫面用「開始遊戲」‹ › 即可在它們之間切換。每個版本各自佔用空間，並單獨構建一次遊戲代碼；存檔共用。再次設定同一版本會替換它自己的副本。"},
